Implemented `School` in `grade_school.py` (exercise: Grade School roster).

**What I implemented:**
- `__init__` — `students` dict (name→grade) + `_added` history list
- `add_student(name, grade)` — records `True` on first add, `False` if the name is already in any grade (matches "cannot be added more than once"); never duplicates
- `roster()` — flat list of all students, sorted by grade then name
- `grade(grade_number)` — alphabetically sorted students in that grade, `[]` if none
- `added()` — returns the `True`/`False` history of `add_student` calls (duplicate detection), resetting its buffer

